    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. The Claimant is Obasi (the \"Claimant\"), a commercial real estate brokerage company, registered",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "and located in Dubai, the UAE.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Defendant is Oreana (the \"Defendant\"), a company registered and located in Dubai, the UAE.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Background",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. On 6 March 2025, the Claimant filed a Claim with the DIFC Courts' Small Claims Tribunal (the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "\"SCT\") seeking payment from the Defendant for brokerage services in the amount of AED 391,123.45",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "based on the lease brokerage agreement the parties entered into (the \"Agreement\").",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. The Defendant failed to attend the first hearing listed before SCT Judge Hayley Norton, while the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Claimant's representative was in attendance (the \"First Hearing\").",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "5. The First Hearing was adjourned to 8 September 2025, in which the Defendant sought to rely on",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "documents that had previously been filed with the Court. The Defendant was directed by Judge",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Norton, to seek permission from the Court to rely upon the documents at such a later stage.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "6. A further hearing for this Claim was held on 2 October 2025, at which the Claimant's and the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Defendant's representatives attended.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "7. The Judgment of SCT Judge Hayley Norton, was issued on 24 October 2025, granting the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Judgment Sum in favour of the Claimant.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "8. On 7 November 2025, the Defendant filed a permission to appeal application to the Judgment (the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "\"Permission to Appeal Application\").",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "9. A permission to appeal hearing was listed before myself on 15 December 2025 (the \"Appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Hearing\").",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p2-b32",
