      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "11. Around an hour before the Appeal Hearing, the Defendant emailed the Registry stating that he was",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "ill and requested an adjournment of the Appeal Hearing.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "12. I requested that the matter proceed as scheduled, and the Defendant appeared stating he was ill",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "suffering from influenza, although no medical certificate was produced. However, he stated that he",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "was finding it difficult to proceed and wanted to instruct legal representation in relation to the matter.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "13. I granted an adjournment until 3:30 that afternoon on 15 December 2025, at which point the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Defendant's appointed legal representation was present. She made it clear that she was not in a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "position to proceed and needed time to review the documents and therefore renewed the application",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "for adjournment.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "14. Notwithstanding the circumstances, I was not prepared to grant an adjournment in those",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "circumstances. It seems to me that the Defendant has had every opportunity to make arrangements to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "appear in relation to this matter.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "15. It also seems so me that given the history of the event of the matters of first instance, there has",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "been two hearings which have been wasted effectively because the Defendant has either failed to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "attend or produced documents late.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "16. The SCT is designed to deal with small claims, but it is important that it deals with them",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "proportionately and in accordance with the sums at stake.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "17. To grant an adjournment in these circumstances seems to me to be unfair and unlikely to be in",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "accordance with the overall objective.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "18. For those reasons, I decide that the adjournment should not be granted.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "The test for Permission to Appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "19. The circumstances in which the Court of First instance may give permission to appeal, are strictly",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "circumscribed by Article 21 of the DIFC Courts law No. 2 2025 which provides:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "\"21. Appeals Against Small Claims Tribunal Judgments",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "A. Judgments of the Small Claims Tribunal may be appealed before the Courts of First",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Instance in accordance with the procedures established under the DIFC Laws, DIFC",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Regulations, Rules of the Courts or any Practice Direction or Order issued by the DIFC",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Courts, where the appeal relates to:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(1) A question of law",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(2) An allegation of a miscarriage of justice",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(3) An issue of procedural fairness; or",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p3-b34",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(4) A matter provided for in or under DIFC Laws.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "20. There is no right to appeal on questions of fact. This is unsurprising given that hearings before the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "SCT are intended to be informal as set out in RDC 53.51 and that the strict rules of evidence do not",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "apply as set out in RDC 53.53.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "The Proposed Grounds of Appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "21. The Defendant has put forward the first ground of appeal being misinterpretation of who",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "introduced the relevant unit.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "22. Under Clause 2 of the Agreement along with what the Defendant says, the Defendant had already",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "been in direct contact with Ofir about management months earlier from January to May 2024,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "regarding the same development.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "23. The Defendant provided evidence of WhatsApp communications demonstrating that multiple",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "unites were proposed directly by Ofir well before the broker's involvement.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "24. This issue was dealt with by the learned judge in her Judgment.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "25. In paragraphs 18 and following, the judge recorded the Defendant submits that it actively searched",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "for a retail space unit for over a year before engaging the service of the Claimant, including registering",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "its interest with Ofir Properties and remaining on its waitlist for several months and exploring leading",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "options with Olivija at onshore Dubai, prior to signing the Agreement.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "26. The Judge returns to this issue in paragraph 33 of the Judgment, where she sets out clause 2 of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "the Agreement.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "27. Clause 2 of the Agreement sets out the requirements for 'introducing' a property, and provides as",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "follows:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "\"The Broker will introduce the suitable properties to the Tenant via email. The Tenant does need to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "have physically visited the properties to be deemed as introduced by the Broker. If the Tenant has",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "already been introduced to the property/s, then an email must be sent to the Broker within two",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(2) business days confirming they have already been introduced to the property/s, these",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "property/s will then not be considered as introduced by the Broker. If this email is not sent by the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "Tenant these properties will be deemed to have been introduced by the Broker.\" [emphasis",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "added]",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "28. As the Judge records, the Claimant sent the introduction email on 13 June 2024, and there is",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "nothing before the Court suggesting that there had already been an introduction. The Judge",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "accordingly found that the email was sufficient evidence to demonstrate the Claimant's introduction to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "the property.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "29. The Judge also found in paragraph 40, that the discussions which had been taking place in",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "relation to the February proposed lease, were in relation to a different property from that ultimately",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p4-b34",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "agreed.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "30. It seems to me, there is no basis for suggesting that the Judge did not consider the relevant",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "evidence and material, or that she came to a wrong conclusion in relation to Clause 2 of the material",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "Agreement.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "31. I, therefore, find there is no real prospects of any success in relation to the misinterpretation of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "their introduction.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "32. The second ground is that the broker's actions were not the effective cause of the lease, and that",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "rather the independent negotiations led to the lease with no contribution from the respondent. This is",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "also dealt with by the Judge in her Judgment, where she refers in paragraph 41, to Clause 4 of the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "Agreement, which reads as follows:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "\"Once a property/building has been introduced by the Broker, the Tenant may not directly contact",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "the Landlord/Owner. If they do so and sign a lease contract within 12 months of the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "introduction, then the commission amount as outlined in this agreement shall become",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "immediately due.\" [emphasis added]",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "33. It follows as it seems to me, that the correct consideration here is not what the effective cause",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "was, but whether the material terms of the agreement were met. I see no basis upon which it can be",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "said that the Judge did not consider anything other than the correct legal test.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "34. The third ground of appeal relates to failure of the Respondent to fulfil its contractual duties.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "35. First, I see no basis upon which it is set out or alleged that there was a breach of these duties.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "Secondly, it seems to me that it would amount to a counterclaim, and third I take the view that these",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "are irrelevant to the Claimant's claim for commission, and I therefore see no prospect of any ground",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "succeeding under this head.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "36. The fourth ground of appeal asserts that material evidence was not considered. This is plainly a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "direct factual challenge, and in any event, it does not seem to me that it is borne out, and I take the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "view that there is no prospect of success.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "37. The fifth ground of appeal alleges incorrect application of clause 4, with which I have already dealt",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "with. I find that there is no basis for a suggestion of a successful appeal.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "38. The alternative request is effectively for time to pay or a reduction. I do not consider that this has",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "any basis on an appeal, and it seems to me that in those circumstances there are no grounds in",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "relation to that.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "3a574fc4f0baa5ec7ff0dcc822d7c55e4f9c493c24addc217c8df3d848c16fa5-p5-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 5,
      "text": "39. For those reasons sets out above, I therefore dismiss the Permission to Appeal Application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    }
  ],
  "tables": []
}
